Kouichi, wait here for a minute.

00:16:36.962 --> 00:16:38.106
What do you think?

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:39.507
It's cute, it's cute!

00:16:39.531 --> 00:16:41.209
Pretty! Pretty!

00:16:41.233 --> 00:16:44.032
| can't believe you're doing this when
you have no plans to buy.

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.680
Why?

00:16:45.704 --> 00:16:46.671
Royal Beauty
Aesthetic Salon

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.018
They would never show up here.

00:16:50.042 --> 00:16:52.374
Ah, Heaven, just Heaven.

00:16:52.911 --> 00:16:55.023
It really feels good.

00:16:55.047 --> 00:16:59.260
Oh, my, you're sweating so much.
You're doing very well!

00:16:59.284 --> 00:17:00.911
Why?

00:17:05.491 --> 00:17:06.925
Why?!

00:17:07.126 --> 00:17:07.888
Why?!

00:17:08.093 --> 00:17:08.924
Why?!

00:17:09.128 --> 00:17:11.106
Why?!

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.241
Mami! Mami!

00:17:13.265 --> 00:17:14.576
Mami, are you okay?!

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:17.312
Oh, Kouichi.

00:17:17.336 --> 00:17:22.069
Mami, are you tired because |
pushed you into doing too much?

00:17:22.808 --> 00:17:25.038
This is more than enough. Let's go home.

00:17:25.577 --> 00:17:27.989
No, that's not it!

00:17:28.013 --> 00:17:29.742
That's not it...

00:17:31.417 --> 00:17:33.852
See? Didn't I tell you it was her?

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:36.884
Yo, what's up? You're all dressed up.

00:17:39.158 --> 00:17:41.736
Mami, are these people your acquaintances?

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:45.253
Well, that is, no, how should I say this?

00:17:46.265 --> 00:17:49.895
| suppose, in a sense, you could
say they are my acquaintances.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.382
Man, sorry about that!
| thought you were someone elsel

00:17:54.406 --> 00:17:54.983
What?!

00:17:55.007 --> 00:17:57.052
Sorry to have bothered you!

00:17:57.076 --> 00:17:58.686
Wait, Ran!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.289
What's going on? That was definitely Mami-rin.

00:18:01.313 --> 00:18:02.991
You saw her outfit.

00:18:03.015 --> 00:18:05.177
She dressed up to match that guy.

00:18:05.584 --> 00:18:07.929
She's serious. That's serious love, man!

00:18:07.953 --> 00:18:10.065
Which means...

00:18:10.089 --> 00:18:14.369
We'll watch over her warmly from afar,
so that they won't notice.

00:18:14.393 --> 00:18:16.471
That's what friends do, right?!

00:18:16.495 --> 00:18:18.473
Oh, nice friendship!

00:18:18.497 --> 00:18:19.340
| don't know about that.

00:18:19.364 --> 00:18:20.942
Ran, you have weird interests.

00:18:20.966 --> 00:18:21.976
Kouichi, this way!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.211
Mami?

00:18:23.235 --> 00:18:24.546
Hey, they ran!

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:26.014
Mami, what's the matter?

00:18:26.038 --> 00:18:27.528
Never mind! This way!

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:29.818
What are we doing in this...

00:18:29.842 --> 00:18:31.686
It's a shortcut.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:32.887
Come on, hurry!

00:18:32.911 --> 00:18:34.923
Kotobuki's bound to come after us.

00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:36.972
| have to hurry and run! I have to run!

00:18:37.316 --> 00:18:38.526
Ow!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.829
Hey, hey, hey, who're you guys?

00:18:40.853 --> 00:18:43.584
Man, that hurt. What the hell
did ya do that for?!

00:18:43.989 --> 00:18:45.433
Who are you people?!

00:18:45.457 --> 00:18:47.755
Since you've asked us, I guess
I'll have to answer.

00:18:48.260 --> 00:18:50.105
We're the group that's currently
on the rise in Shibuya,

00:18:50.129 --> 00:18:52.655
the Devil Pippopotamuses, that's us!

00:18:52.998 --> 00:18:54.557
Devil!

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.111
Lame...

00:18:56.135 --> 00:18:57.345
Hey, what did you just say?!

00:18:57.369 --> 00:18:59.380
You've got some guts saying that, lady.

00:18:59.404 --> 00:19:00.748
Stop it, you guys!

00:19:00.772 --> 00:19:06.233
Hey, bro, you try to act too cool
and you're gonna be sorry!

00:19:07.212 --> 00:19:09.613
Platform sandal kick!

00:19:11.483 --> 00:19:12.927
You're Ran Kotobuki!

00:19:12.951 --> 00:19:14.662
Meeting us here is gonna be your doom!

00:19:14.686 --> 00:19:17.465
We'll defeat you and take
Shibuya for ourselves!

00:19:17.489 --> 00:19:20.891
Well, well, look at these small fry
getting all high and mighty.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.858
Hey, you there, stranger lady.

00:19:24.363 --> 00:19:27.196
It'll be dangerous to stick around here.
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:19:28.267 --> 00:19:29.410
Mami, let's go.

00:19:29.434 --> 00:19:30.230
But...

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:32.914
Mami!

00:19:32.938 --> 00:19:34.449
But she saved us.

00:19:34.473 --> 00:19:36.441
Forget it, just leave them!

00:19:36.808 --> 00:19:38.019
Mami, listen to me.

00:19:38.043 --> 00:19:40.321
You should never get involved
with people like that.

00:19:40.345 --> 00:19:42.712
We live in a completely different
world than they do.

00:19:43.148 --> 00:19:45.226
We can just leave them to their devices!

00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:47.480
Come on, Mami, let's hurry up
and get away from here!

00:19:50.923 --> 00:19:52.687
Let go.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:19:56.427
Shoot!

00:20:02.134 --> 00:20:03.898
What the?!

00:20:07.105 --> 00:20:08.683
Damn small fry.

00:20:08.707 --> 00:20:11.953
Take a good look at who you'll be
fighting before you pick a fight!

00:20:11.977 --> 00:20:13.521
What?!

00:20:13.545 --> 00:20:15.523
Who the hell are you?!

00:20:15.547 --> 00:20:19.074
I'm Mami Honda of Bukuro! Take me
on and you're gonna get hurt!

00:20:19.451 --> 00:20:20.885
Get 'em!

00:20:21.587 --> 00:20:23.385
What?!

00:20:32.631 --> 00:20:35.176
Thanks, Mami-rin, just what
I'd expect from you.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:37.045
You were a great help.

00:20:37.069 --> 00:20:39.314
You should take care of your trash
on a regular basis.

00:20:39.338 --> 00:20:41.136
We're even now.

00:20:43.575 --> 00:20:45.987
Man, that exercise made me hungry.

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:47.979
I'm gonna go eat at the buffet again!

00:20:49.448 --> 00:20:51.041
Mami...

00:20:51.316 --> 00:20:52.860
Mami!

00:20:52.884 --> 00:20:54.852
Wait, Mami!

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.113
Mami, you...

00:20:58.357 --> 00:21:00.121
That's right, I'm a gal.

00:21:01.159 --> 00:21:04.939
| realized one day that there are
a lot of things in the world

00:21:04.963 --> 00:21:08.126
| can't experience as a daughter
of the Honda Family.

00:21:09.701 --> 00:21:12.547
I'll experience all sorts of things
and polish myself,

00:21:12.571 --> 00:21:14.300
polish myself as a woman.

00:21:15.007 --> 00:21:18.739
| want to grow up into a great woman!
The best woman in the world!

00:21:19.344 --> 00:21:22.473
Kou, thank you. I had fun today. Bye.

00:21:26.518 --> 00:21:28.043
Mami...

00:21:29.054 --> 00:21:31.032
Man, that was stupid.

00:21:31.056 --> 00:21:33.491
They're serious when they say
first loves never succeed.

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:44.597
| had another dream
from my childhood.

00:21:45.771 --> 00:21:47.364
Miss Mami...

00:21:47.639 --> 00:21:50.084
There is an airmail for you from
an old friend of yours.

00:21:50.108 --> 00:21:51.986
From who?

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:54.522
From Mr. Junichiro Aoyama
of the Aoyama Combine,

00:21:54.546 --> 00:21:58.626
who went to study abroad
in England five years ago.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:22:00.482
What?! For real?! For real?!

00:22:01.286 --> 00:22:02.754
Jun...

00:22:03.588 --> 00:22:08.651
So, dreaming about my memories of Jun
last night wasn't a coincidence.

00:22:09.494 --> 00:22:12.464
He's grown into such a fine gentleman.

00:22:13.298 --> 00:22:14.942
Okay, salmon roe! Thanks for waiting!

00:22:14.966 --> 00:22:16.144
Thanks, I've had enough.

00:22:16.168 --> 00:22:19.013
Okay, check for guest number one!
Thanks for coming!

00:22:19.037 --> 00:22:22.234
Oh, where should we go for our date?

00:22:25.777 --> 00:22:29.441
You guys, be careful of the raw stuff
during the summer.

00:22:32.718 --> 00:22:34.243
Jun!

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:42.003
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:42.027 --> 00:22:48.194
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.633 --> 00:22:54.949
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.973 --> 00:23:00.275
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.246 --> 00:23:07.528
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.552 --> 00:23:13.321
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.892 --> 00:23:20.174
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.198 --> 00:23:25.913
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.937 --> 00:23:31.876
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.277 --> 00:23:37.859
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.883 --> 00:23:45.400
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.424 --> 00:23:51.339
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.363 --> 00:23:58.012
If only I had more courage

00:23:58.036 --> 00:24:04.442
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.343 --> 00:24:06.421
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.445 --> 00:24:09.490
Next Super GALS! Twenty-five years as a
teacher! | want to grant Naka-teach's wish!

00:24:09.514 --> 00:24:10.191
Next Super GALS!
We wanna win the sports fest no matter what!

00:24:10.215 --> 00:24:10.825
We wanna win the sports fest no matter what!

00:24:10.849 --> 00:24:12.660
We wanna see and hug the victory trophy!

00:24:12.684 --> 00:24:14.295
But year after year, Naka-teach
has come in dead last

00:24:14.319 --> 00:24:16.697
and standing in his way is the
strongest class led by Gunjo!

00:24:16.721 --> 00:24:19.734
Gunjo's bragging about how strong they are,
and I don't like his attitude!

00:24:19.758 --> 00:24:21.469
All right, Naka-teach! Leave it to me!

00:24:21.493 --> 00:24:25.106
I'll get that shining victory trophy
for you no matter what!

00:24:25.130 --> 00:24:27.475
In exchange, forget about my
homework if we win, okay?

00:24:27.499 --> 00:24:27.642
Next time on Super Gals Ran Kotobuki,

